# Play test of Primeval Park (CIPlay primeval_park, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The dock on the bay's south shore (30 -19..-4, deck 1.6 m), the welcome arch at 30 -25; the visitor centre's terrace
# (7 m) at the crescent's middle, its block x -18..-6 z -6.5..11.5 (the lobby's door in its front's west half), the
# maintenance shed at its west end (x -35..-24.5 z 5.5..16); the boar paddock (x -20..4 z 29..45, 5 m) and the keeper's
# hut (8..12.5 43..47.5, floor 6.1 m); the river ride's channel (50 -21 to 60 -58) and its station (59.5-62.5 -63..-57);
# the power house's yard (31..49 -60..-44, 6.5 m); the aviary on the south horn's hilltop (0 -45, 12 m; the keeper's
# platform 18 m); the show lagoon at the bay's head (24 22, 12 m deep) with its feeding platform (6.5..17 21..24, 1.5 m);
# the great gate across the north horn (-12 56), the Queen's valley behind it, the keeper lodge at 2 84.
island Primeval Park
offset -1.155 0.7575
expect step 0
expect title Welcome to Primeval Park
wait 5
expect animals Llama 2
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Turtle 2
expect animals Dolphin 3

# Chapter 1 - arrival: the dock, the notice under the arch, the kiosk; the visitor centre and the engineer's report
walk 31 -33 to 31 -23 h=1.1
zone dock
expect step 1
read Evacuation notice
expect step 2
open Dock kiosk box
at -14 -12 h=7.5
walk -16.5 -11 to -16.5 -3 h=7
zone visitorcentre
expect step 3
read Chief engineer's report
expect step 4
expect shown mapoff
open Gift shop crate
open Restaurant fridge

# Chapter 2 - the power: the shed's fuse; the ironbacks and the boar keeper's fuse; the river ride's sunk boat; the master
# switch (the great gate's panel still wants the card and the key)
open Maintenance shed box
expect story fuse 1
expect step 5
at -4 36 h=5.5
zone boarpaddock
kill Warthog
expect step 6
at 10.25 45.5 h=6.3
open Boar keeper's locker
expect story fuse 2
expect step 7
at 61 -68 h=2.5
walk 61 -67 to 61 -61 h=2.1
zone river
expect step 8
at 60.3 -52 h=-1
open Sunken tour boat's box
expect story fuse 3
expect step 9
at 40 -40 h=7
walk 40 -41 to 40 -45.5 h=6.5
use masterswitch
expect story gatecard 1
expect step 10
expect shown parklights
expect shown mapon
expect hidden mapoff

# Chapter 3 - the aviary and the lagoon
at 0 -45 h=18.5
zone aviary
expect step 11
kill Screecher
expect step 12
read Aviary keeper's notes
expect step 13
open Aviary keeper's locker
at 10 22.5 h=2
zone lagoonshow
expect step 14
kill Angler fish
expect step 15
at 25 18.5 h=-9
open Box on the lagoon floor
expect story queenkey 1
expect step 16
open Sunk feed barrel

# Chapter 4 - the Queen: the gate's panel, her valley, the keeper lodge
at 0 49 h=6
use gatepanel
expect message the great gate sinks
wait 9
walk 0 50 to -12 51 to -12 60 to -12 66 h=9.6
zone queengate
expect step 17
kill Mama bear
expect step 18
read Founder's farewell
expect step 19
open Founder's vault
wait 3
expect done
# Raft's story machinery: the feed chest in the dog cage in the paddock's corner - refused while the cage is chained; the
# bolt cutters from the keeper's tool chest; the cage opens and the chest with it. The camera on the keeper's hut sweeps
open Boar keeper's feed chest
expect message cage is chained shut
use feedcage
expect message Bolt cutters would get through
open Keeper's tool chest
expect story raft-Vasagatan_BoltCutter 1
use feedcage
expect hidden feedcage
open Boar keeper's feed chest
expect item Leather 2
expect spinsown paddockcam
